            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Добавь пять к значению переменной <code>inventory</code>.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"inventory = \" /><text value=\"11\" class=\"number\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"inventory = inventory + \" /><text value=\"5\" class=\"number\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"print(inventory)\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"27\" endIndex=\"40\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"5\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"16\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Обязательно выбери <code>inventory + 5</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Добавь пять к значению переменной <code>inventory</code>, чтобы код вывел <code>16</code>.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"inventory = \" /><text value=\"11\" class=\"number\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"inventory = inventory + \" /><text value=\"5\" class=\"number\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"print(inventory)\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"27\" endIndex=\"40\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"inventory - 5\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"inventory + 6\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"16\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Обязательно выбери <code>inventory + 5</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Example: Why self-assigning matters",
            "id": 78044,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Вычти один из значения переменной <code>cards</code>, затем добавь четыре.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"cards = \" /><text value=\"3\" class=\"number\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"cards = cards - \" /><text value=\"1\" class=\"number\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"cards = cards + \" /><text value=\"4\" class=\"number\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"print(cards)\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"24\" endIndex=\"25\" /><option startIndex=\"26\" endIndex=\"27\" /><option startIndex=\"42\" endIndex=\"43\" /><option startIndex=\"44\" endIndex=\"45\" /></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"6\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Обязательно выбери <code>-</code>, затем <code>1</code>, а затем <code>+</code>, <code>4</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Начни с <code>3</code>, вычти один из <code>cards</code>, а затем добавь четыре, чтобы код вывел <code>6</code>.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"cards = \" /><text value=\"3\" class=\"number\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"cards = cards - \" /><text value=\"1\" class=\"number\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"cards = cards + \" /><text value=\"4\" class=\"number\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"print(cards)\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"24\" endIndex=\"25\" /><option startIndex=\"26\" endIndex=\"27\" /><option startIndex=\"42\" endIndex=\"43\" /><option startIndex=\"44\" endIndex=\"45\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"*\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"3\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"6\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"6\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Обязательно выбери <code>-</code>, затем <code>1</code>, <code>+</code>, и наконец <code>4</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeSelected": true
