            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Выведи <code>Jennifer Lopez</code> в консоль, используя переменную <code>name</code>.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"name = \" /><text value=\"&quot;Jennifer&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"name = name + \" /><text value=\"&quot; Lopez&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"print(name)\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"validatedInput\" isDefault=\"true\" startIndex=\"25\" endIndex=\"29\" /></interactions><output><content><text value=\"Jennifer Lopez\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Обязательно выбери <code>name</code>.</p></body></html>"
